␀.␀u␀s␀e␀r␀s␀-␀m␀a␀n␀a␀g␀e␀m␀e␀n␀t␀-␀g␀r␀i␀d␀{␀d␀i␀s␀p␀l␀a␀y␀:␀g␀r␀i␀d␀;␀g␀r␀i␀d␀-␀t␀e␀m␀p␀l␀a␀t␀e␀-␀c␀o␀l␀u␀m␀n␀s␀:␀r␀e␀p␀e␀a␀t␀(␀a␀u␀t␀o␀-␀f␀i␀l␀l␀,␀m␀i␀n␀m␀a␀x␀(␀2␀8␀0␀p␀x␀,␀1␀f␀r␀)␀)␀;␀g␀a␀p␀:␀1␀4␀p␀x␀}␀
␀.␀u␀s␀e␀r␀-␀c␀a␀r␀d␀{␀d␀i␀s␀p␀l␀a␀y␀:␀g␀r␀i␀d␀;␀g␀r␀i␀d␀-␀t␀e␀m␀p␀l␀a␀t␀e␀-␀c␀o␀l␀u␀m␀n␀s␀:␀1␀f␀r␀ ␀a␀u␀t␀o␀;␀a␀l␀i␀g␀n␀-␀i␀t␀e␀m␀s␀:␀c␀e␀n␀t␀e␀r␀;␀g␀a␀p␀:␀1␀2␀p␀x␀;␀p␀a␀d␀d␀i␀n␀g␀:␀1␀4␀p␀x␀;␀b␀o␀r␀d␀e␀r␀:␀1␀p␀x␀ ␀s␀o␀l␀i␀d␀ ␀v␀a␀r␀(␀-␀-␀l␀i␀n␀e␀)␀;␀b␀o␀r␀d␀e␀r␀-␀r␀a␀d␀i␀u␀s␀:␀1␀4␀p␀x␀;␀b␀a␀c␀k␀g␀r␀o␀u␀n␀d␀:␀w␀h␀i␀t␀e␀}␀
␀.␀u␀s␀e␀r␀-␀i␀n␀f␀o␀{␀d␀i␀s␀p␀l␀a␀y␀:␀g␀r␀i␀d␀;␀g␀a␀p␀:␀4␀p␀x␀}␀
␀.␀u␀s␀e␀r␀-␀i␀n␀f␀o␀ ␀s␀t␀r␀o␀n␀g␀{␀f␀o␀n␀t␀-␀s␀i␀z␀e␀:␀1␀4␀p␀x␀}␀
␀.␀u␀s␀e␀r␀-␀i␀n␀f␀o␀ ␀.␀m␀u␀t␀e␀d␀{␀f␀o␀n␀t␀-␀s␀i␀z␀e␀:␀1␀2␀p␀x␀}␀
␀.␀u␀s␀e␀r␀-␀a␀c␀t␀i␀o␀n␀s␀{␀d␀i␀s␀p␀l␀a␀y␀:␀f␀l␀e␀x␀;␀g␀a␀p␀:␀6␀p␀x␀}␀
␀.␀b␀u␀t␀t␀o␀n␀-␀g␀r␀o␀u␀p␀{␀d␀i␀s␀p␀l␀a␀y␀:␀f␀l␀e␀x␀;␀g␀a␀p␀:␀8␀p␀x␀;␀m␀a␀r␀g␀i␀n␀-␀t␀o␀p␀:␀1␀4␀p␀x␀}␀
